{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":96,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"017e4896-344d-4db1-a6e2-1de9d424739a","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151193893,"PostDateInt":1779173063000,"PostDate":"2026-05-19T14:44:23","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"财务会计","OrgId":1704216,"Org":"集团财务核算分析部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·宝安区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"工作职责：\n1.应付核对：核对采购付款申请和报销单据，管理进项发票；定期与供应商对账，检查明细账和往来科目余额的准确性；\n2.应收核对：负责公司发票开具和往来账务核对，编制并审核应收到期欠款表；跟踪销售合同的执行情况，负责应收账款管理工作；\n3.成本核算：负责产品成本核算，每月准确完成制造费用归集和分摊，结转主营业务成本，及时完成成本模块的关账工作；\n4.独立负责子公司的全盘账务处理，严格审核原始凭证的合法性、精准性，规范编制记账凭证，每月做好结账工作并出具报表；\n5.根据会计准则要求健全完善公司财务核算体系和内控规范制度，协助开展内控流程梳理和单据检查。","Require":"岗位要求：\n1.全日制统招本科以上学历，专业要求财务、审计等财务相关专业。\n2.至少3年财务或审计相关工作经验，有IPO项目上市经验或制造业财务经验优先录用；\n3.熟悉最新的会计准则和政策法规； \n4.能够运用数据库工具或者高阶的Excel功能进行数据分析；\n5.要求具备中级会计职称，有CPA的优先录用；\n6.具备扎实的财务专业知识、良好的沟通协调能力。","ClassificationOne":"社招","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-19T14:44:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"